        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>The Placebo Effect: Are Expensive Placebos More Effective Than Cheap Placebos?</title>\n    <style>\n        * { \n            box-sizing: border-box; \n            margin: 0; \n            padding: 0; \n        }\n        body { \n            background-color: #2c2c2c; \n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; \n            padding: 30px; \n            display: flex; \n            justify-content: center; \n        }\n        \n        .infographic { \n            width: 800px; \n            background-color: #ffffff; \n            overflow: hidden; \n            display: flex; \n            flex-direction: column; \n            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n        }\n        \n        .header { \n            background-color: #6d61a8; \n            color: #ffffff; \n            text-align: center; \n            padding: 25px 40px; \n        }\n        .header h1 { \n            font-family: 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif; \n            font-size: 34px; \n            font-weight: 500; \n            line-height: 1.2; \n        }\n        \n        .section-wrapper { \n            position: relative; \n            width: 100%; \n        }\n        \n        .content-box { \n            width: 92%; \n            margin: 0 auto; \n            padding: 40px 30px; \n            color: #ffffff; \n            display: flex; \n        }\n        .content-box h2 { \n            font-family: 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif; \n            font-size: 34px; \n            margin-bottom: 15px; \n            font-weight: 500; \n        }\n        .content-box p { \n            font-size: 15px; \n            line-height: 1.45; \n            margin-bottom: 20px; \n        }\n        .content-box p:last-of-type { \n            margin-bottom: 0; \n        }\n        \n        .teal-bg { background-color: #5ec2cc; }\n        .purple-bg { background-color: #8273c9; }\n        \n        .shelf { \n            width: 100%; \n            display: flex; \n            flex-direction: column; \n        }\n        .shelf-top { height: 10px; }\n        .shelf-bottom { height: 16px; }\n        \n        .shelf-teal .shelf-top { background-color: #7bd3dc; }\n        .shelf-teal .shelf-bottom { background-color: #49a2ac; }\n        \n        .shelf-purple .shelf-top { background-color: #9a8cd6; }\n        .shelf-purple .shelf-bottom { background-color: #6153a1; }\n        \n        .row-2-col { \n            align-items: center; \n            gap: 30px; \n        }\n        .col-left { \n            flex: 0 0 45%; \n            display: flex; \n            justify-content: center; \n        }\n        .col-right { \n            flex: 1; \n        }\n        \n        .row-split { \n            gap: 40px; \n            align-items: flex-start; \n        }\n        .col-half { \n            flex: 1; \n            display: flex; \n            flex-direction: column; \n        }\n        \n        .placeholder { \n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); \n            border: 2px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); \n            display: flex; \n            align-items: center; \n            justify-content: center; \n            color: #ffffff; \n            font-size: 14px; \n            text-align: center; \n            padding: 15px; \n        }\n        \n        .footer { \n            background-color: #ffffff; \n            padding: 25px 35px; \n            display: flex; \n            align-items: center; \n            gap: 25px; \n        }\n        .footer-logo { \n            font-family: 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif; \n            font-size: 48px; \n            font-weight: 900; \n            color: #6d61a8; \n            letter-spacing: -1px; \n        }\n        .footer-text { \n            flex: 1; \n            font-size: 10.5px; \n            line-height: 1.4; \n        }\n        .footer-text .study { \n            color: #444444; \n            font-weight: bold; \n            margin-bottom: 3px; \n            display: block; \n        }\n        .footer-text .refs { \n            color: #5ec2cc; \n            display: block; \n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"infographic\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <h1>The Placebo Effect: Are Expensive Placebos<br>More Effective Than Cheap Placebos?</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"section-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"content-box teal-bg row-2-col\">\n                <div class=\"col-left\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 160px;\">[Illustration: Pill bottles and price tag]</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-right\">\n                    <h2>Purpose</h2>\n                    <p>In what ways can fictitious costs impact the effectiveness of a placebo? To better understand how the 'placebo effect' takes place, we will provide placebos of different reported costs and measure their impact on the patients.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"shelf shelf-teal\">\n                <div class=\"shelf-top\"></div>\n                <div class=\"shelf-bottom\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"section-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"content-box purple-bg row-2-col\">\n                <div class=\"col-left\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 160px;\">[Illustration: Pill, stacked coins, and cash]</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-right\">\n                    <h2>Hypothesis</h2>\n                    <p>Providing placebos that are 'expensive' will amplify the placebo effect of actual placebos with participants.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"shelf shelf-purple\">\n                <div class=\"shelf-top\"></div>\n                <div class=\"shelf-bottom\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"section-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"content-box teal-bg row-split\">\n                <div class=\"col-half\">\n                    <h2>Method</h2>\n                    <p>Participants suffering from Parkinson's Disease serve as placebo effect test subjects.</p>\n                    <p>Each participant receives an effective drug valued at $100 per dose and then motor function changes are measured. After each participant receives an effective drug said to be valued at $1500 per dose, then their motor functions are measured again.</p>\n                    <p>A comparison between motor function improvements following the administration of each placebo will help determine whether fictitious costs can influence the effectiveness of a placebo.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-half\">\n                    <h2>Results</h2>\n                    <p>The study found motor functions improve significantly more for participants following the administration of a reportedly $1500 placebo, compared to a reportedly $100 placebo.</p>\n                    <p>While the degree of improvement in motor function for participants varied due to the administration of a $1500 placebo drug, all participants experienced improved motor functions. A higher cost for a placebo will improve patients' conditions even more.</p>\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 130px; margin: 30px 0 0 auto;\">[Illustration: First aid kit and clipboard]</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"shelf shelf-teal\">\n                <div class=\"shelf-top\"></div>\n                <div class=\"shelf-bottom\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            <div class=\"footer-logo\">M.I.S.H.B</div>\n            <div class=\"footer-text\">\n                <span class=\"study\">Study by Janelle Mauricio, Vanessa Garby, Shivinder Singh - The Massy Institute for Studies of Human Behavior</span>\n                <span class=\"refs\">References: Kemputo, Odelle., \"The psychology of self-deception\" The Anaptic Journal, 2017 // Satuda, Evan., Temitope, Andrew., \"Neuroscience of Decision-Making\" The Science Review, 2018 // Brahms, Hansen., Leigh, Anderson., \"The Need and Neurology for Happiness\", The Arch Journal, 2020</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
